msgctxt "ExploratoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The number of factors to extract. To determine this number, use the Number "
"of Factors/Components analysis."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "變項"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "In this box, the variables to perform the analysis on are selected"
msgstr "於此方框中選取欲進行分析之變項"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Data"
msgstr "資料"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Specifies whether the data is raw, meaning observations in rows and "
"variables in columns, or whether the data is a variance-covariance matrix. "
"For the latter, the sample size is required."
msgstr ""
"指定資料為原始資料（即觀察值於列、變項於欄），或為變異數-共變數矩陣。若為後"
"者，則需提供樣本數。"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Raw"
msgstr "原始"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Variance-covariance matrix"
msgstr "變異數-共變數矩陣"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Sample size"
msgstr "樣本數"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Analysis Options"
msgstr "分析選項"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Eigenvalues"
msgstr "特徵值"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Settings for the eigenvalues used by the parallel analysis, the eigenvalue "
"criterion and the scree plot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Whether principal component eigenvalues (PC) or factor eigenvalues (FA) are "
"used for the parallel analysis, the eigenvalue criterion and the scree plot. "
"PC-based eigenvalues are a common choice also when the goal is to determine "
"the number of factors for a factor analysis."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Principal components"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Factors"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Threshold"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Threshold for the eigenvalue criterion: factors/components with an "
"eigenvalue above this value are suggested for retention. The default of 1 "
"corresponds to the Kaiser criterion. The eigenvalue type (principal "
"component or factor eigenvalues) follows the method selected above."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Parallel Analysis"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Parallel analysis compares the eigenvalues of the data to eigenvalues of "
"simulated random data. Factors/components are suggested for retention when "
"their eigenvalue is greater than the 95th percentile of the simulated "
"eigenvalues."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Number of iterations"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"The number of random datasets generated for the parallel analysis. The "
"suggested number is based on the 95th percentile of the simulated "
"eigenvalues, which becomes more stable with more iterations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Correlation Matrix"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Which type of correlation matrix the analysis is based on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Pearson"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "The Pearson correlation matrix is used."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Polychoric/tetrachoric"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"The polychoric/tetrachoric correlation matrix is used. This is sometimes "
"unstable when sample size is small and when some variables do not contain "
"all response categories"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Missing Values"
msgstr "遺漏值"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Select how to handle missing values."
msgstr "選擇缺失值之處理方式。"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Exclude cases pairwise"
msgstr "成對排除法"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"If one observation from a variable is missing, all the other variable "
"observations from the same case will still be used for the analysis. In this "
"scenario, it is not necessary to have an observation for all the variables "
"to include the case in the analysis. This option is selected by default."
msgstr ""
"若某個變項的觀測值遺失，該案例中其他變項的觀測值仍會被用於分析。在此情況下，"
"不需要所有變項皆有觀測值即可將該案例納入分析。此選項為預設選取。"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Exclude cases listwise"
msgstr "完全排除法"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"If one observation from a variable is missing, the whole case, so all the "
"other connected variable observations, will be dismissed from the analysis. "
"In this scenario, observations for every variable are needed to include the "
"case in the analysis. "
msgstr ""
"若某變項之任一觀察值缺失，則該案例（即該案例所有其他相關變項之觀察值）將自分"
"析中排除。在此情況下，需所有變項均有觀察值，該案例方能納入分析。 "

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Output Options"
msgstr "輸出選項"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Parallel analysis table"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Displays a table with the real data eigenvalues and the mean eigenvalues of "
"the simulated data. Factors/components suggested for retention are marked "
"with an asterisk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "MAP table"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Displays a table with the average squared partial correlation after "
"partialling out 0, 1, 2, ... principal components (Velicer's minimum average "
"partial test). The number of components with the lowest value is suggested "
"for retention and marked with an asterisk. This suggestion is always shown "
"in the summary table. It is based on principal components, independent of "
"the method selected under Eigenvalues."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Scree plot"
msgstr "陡坡圖"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Displays a scree plot. The scree plot provides information on how much "
"variance in the data, indicated by the eigenvalue, is explained by each "
"factor/component. The horizontal line marks the eigenvalue threshold."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Parallel analysis results"
msgstr "平行分析結果"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Display the mean eigenvalues of the simulated data from the parallel "
"analysis in the scree plot."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "PrincipalComponentAnalysis|"
msgid "Number of components"
msgstr "成分個數"

msgctxt "PrincipalComponentAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The number of components to extract. To determine this number, use the "
"Number of Factors/Components analysis."
msgstr ""

